<view class="page-shell profile-page">
  <view class="profile-hero">
    <text class="brand-word profile-brand">púsy</text>
    <text class="profile-kicker">PÚSY CLUB</text>
    <text class="profile-title">你的美，\n由你定义</text>
    <text class="profile-copy">登录后可在网站与小程序之间共享会员、订单、地址和售后记录。</text>
    <view class="profile-login" role="button" aria-label="{{loggedIn ? memberName + '，' + loginStatus : '微信快捷登录'}}" bindtap="login">{{loginBusy ? '登录中…' : (loggedIn ? memberName + ' · ' + loginStatus : '微信快捷登录')}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="member-card">
    <view>
      <text class="member-label">当前状态</text>
      <text class="member-value">{{loginStatus}}</text>
      <text wx:if="{{memberSummary}}" class="member-label">{{memberSummary}}</text>
    </view>
    <view bindtap="openCart">
      <text class="member-label">购物袋</text>
      <text class="member-value">{{cartCount}}件商品 →</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="profile-services">
    <view wx:for="{{services}}" wx:key="key" class="service-item" bindtap="openService" data-key="{{item.key}}">
      <view>
        <view class="service-title-row"><text class="service-label">{{item.label}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.key === 'notifications' && notificationUnread}}" class="service-badge">{{notificationUnread > 99 ? '99+' : notificationUnread}}</text></view>
        <text class="service-caption">{{item.caption}}</text>
      </view>
      <text class="service-arrow">→</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="preview-note">
    <text class="preview-title">认证前开发模式</text>
    <text>商品会优先连接本机统一 API，连接失败时自动使用内置数据。登录仅建立本地预览身份，不生成 OpenID；认证后配置服务器密钥即可切换真实微信登录。</text>
  </view>
</view>
